id: DRAFT-uhttpmock-0.11.0-meson-supply-native-rewrite-dual-includedirs
trigger_tool: meson|conan|cmake
phase: building|testing
error_signature: Unknown compiler\(s\).*clang|Pkg-config for machine host machine not found|libuhttpmock-1\.0/uhttpmock/uhm\.h.*file not found|uhttpmock/uhm-message\.h.*file not found|TLS support is not available
severity: 3
category: build-system, testing, ohos
match_keywords: meson_native_file, pkgconfig_pre_pin, compiler_path_missing, dual_includedirs, ohos_feature_tls_gap
title: Meson配方OHOS真机缺meson/pkg-config且profile编译器路径缺失时的供给与native file重写及版本化头双根
root_cause: HMBS仅注入cmake/make/ninja/python3而profile将compiler_executables钉死在不存在的/data/service/hnp/bin/clang且MesonToolchain默认不写pkgconfig行，裸路径烘焙致Unknown compiler与glib-2.0 pkg-config查询失败；上游头为include/libuhttpmock-1.0子目录而内部短前缀包含需双根；OHOS glib栈仅GDummyTlsBackend无GIO TLS模块致TLS子项失败
affected_scope: HMBS仅提供cmake/make/ninja/python3且profile编译器路径缺失的Meson加pkg-config加版本化头库，尤其依赖glib-2.0且头安装在include下带版本子目录内部互含的库
verification_cmd: 真机复检确认conan_meson_native.ini中c/cpp与pkgconfig均为存在性校验后绝对路径，上游meson test为2/2/1/1加gaps含GDummyTlsBackend与server.c 321，test_package经conan_toolchain.cmake重写后建成且双include根下两类include均可定位
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: meson-tool-supply-plus-native-rewrite-dual-roots
rec_description: build_requirements以tool_requires供给meson与pkgconf，generate内经conf存在性校验后探测真clang并预先pin pkgconfig绝对路径加PKG_CONFIG导出，生成后重写native file的c与cpp行与无行插入pkgconfig，test_package侧同理重写conan_toolchain.cmake，主包includedirs取include与include下版本子目录双根，TLS失败保留gaps转警告继续打包
rec_command: conanfile.py加tool_requires meson 1.11.0加pkgconf 3.0.5；generate后重写conan_meson_native.ini与conan_toolchain.cmake；package_info includedirs为include与include/libuhttpmock-1.0
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: conan-recipe-plus-test-package
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: keep-gaps-warn-continue-package
fallback_description: 若上游TLS等ohos_feature缺口已合规记录且库本体可打包，将build失败分支由raise改为警告继续打包以放行test_package补全双标记，无gaps未知失败仍硬失败
fallback_auto_fix: false
forbid_1_pattern: /data/service/hnp/bin/clang
forbid_1_reason: 禁止保留profile钉死但worker上不存在的编译器绝对路径或把clang驱动冒充为as，必须经conf存在性校验后重写为真实存在可执行文件
forbid_1_consequence: meson setup报Unknown compiler并ENOENT中断，上游零执行且test_package亦因conan_toolchain.cmake烘焙同路径而配置失败
similar_to: [DRAFT-fcft-3.3.3-pkgconf-supply, DRAFT-bzrtp-5.3.105-compiler-probe-doctrine]
doc_file: knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-uhttpmock-0.11.0-meson-supply-native-rewrite-dual-includedirs.md
last_updated: 2026-09-25
source_event: uhttpmock/0.11.0真机预检meson缺失到编译器缺失到pkg-config缺失到双根与TLS缺口全链路修复
authors: hmbs-executor
source_pr: 12659
